              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <!-- ADDED -->
        <p class="note">If tests show no clear cause, the diagnosis is unexplained infertility. This is common and does not mean treatment will fail. Dr. Kamran will go through the options with you, including <a href={L.iui}>IUI</a> and <a href={L.ivf}>IVF</a>. You can also bring your reports for a <a href={L.support}>second opinion</a>.</p>
